5:30,31; Re 18:7,8 because. Ex 10:3; Job 9:4; 40:2,9; Isa 13:11; 45:9; 2Th 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-25","title":"Jeremiah 50:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>opened. 35-38; 51:11,20; Ps 45:3,5; Isa 13:2-5,17,18; 21:7-9 this. 15; 51:12,25,55; Isa 14:22-24; 46:10,11; 48:14,15; Am 3:6; Re 18:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-26","title":"Jeremiah 50:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>against. 41; 51:27,28; Isa 5:26 the utmost. Heb. the end. open. 10; 51:44; Isa 45:3 cast her up. or, tread her. Isa 10:6; 25:10; 63:3,4; Mic 7:10; Re 14:19; 19:15 destroy. 13,15,23; 51:25,26,64; Isa 14:23; Re 18:21-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-27","title":"Jeremiah 50:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>bullocks. 11; 46:21; Ps 22:12; Isa 34:7; Eze 39:17-20; Re 19:17 their day. 31; 27:7; 48:44; Ps 37:13; La 1:21; Eze 7:5-7; Re 16:17-19; 18:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-28","title":"Jeremiah 50:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>voice. 51:50,51; Isa 48:20 to declare. 15; 51:10,11; Ps 149:6-9; Da 5:3-5,23; Zec 12:2,3 vengeance of his. La 1:10; 2:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-29","title":"Jeremiah 50:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>the archers. 9,14,26 recompense. 15; 51:56; Ps 137:8,9; Re 16:6; 18:6 for she hath. 24,32; Ex 10:3; Isa 14:13,14; 37:23; 47:10; Da 4:37; 5:23; 11:36 2Th 2:4; Re 13:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-30","title":"Jeremiah 50:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>Therefore.Gobrias and Gadates, when they entered Babylon, marched directly to the palace, killing all they met.</p>\n<p>her young. 9:21; 18:21; 48:15; 49:26; 51:3,4; Isa 13:15-18 all her. 36; 51:56,57; Re 6:15; 19:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-31","title":"Jeremiah 50:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>I am. 21:13; 51:25; Eze 5:8; 29:3,9,10; 38:3; 39:1; Na 2:13; 3:5 O thou. 29,32; 48:29; 49:16; Job 40:11,12; Da 4:30,31; Hab 2:4,5; Jas 4:6 1Pe 5:5 most proud. Heb. pride. for. 27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-32","title":"Jeremiah 50:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>the most proud. Heb. pride. Pr 16:18; 18:12; Isa 10:12-15; 14:13-15; Eze 28:2-9; Da 5:20,23-30 none. 51:26,64; Re 18:8 kindle. 21:14; 49:27; De 32:22; Am 1:4,7,10,12,14; 2:2,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-33","title":"Jeremiah 50:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>and all. 7,17,18; 51:34-36; Isa 14:17; 47:6; 49:24-26; 51:23; 52:4-6 Zec 1:15,16 they refused. 34:15-18; Ex 5:2; 8:2; 9:2,3,17,18; Isa 14:17; 58:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-34","title":"Jeremiah 50:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>Redeemer. Ex 6:6; Pr 23:11; Isa 41:14; 43:14; 44:6,23,24; 47:4; 54:5; Mic 4:10 Re 18:8 plead. 51:36; Ps 35:1; 43:1; Pr 22:23; Isa 51:22; Mic 7:9 that he. Isa 14:3-7; 2Th 1:6,7; Re 19:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-50-35","title":"Jeremiah 50:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>sword. 47:6; Le 26:25; Isa 66:16; Eze 14:2; Ho 11:6; Zec 11:17 upon her princes. 27,30; 51:39,57; Isa 41:25; Da 5:1,2,30 her wise m